+    TP2 run. The dummy->real TP barrier is before the checks and does not
+    order this. A non-publishing rank cannot separate "this step's fan-out
+    arrived early" from "last step's signal was never consumed", because the
+    flag is binary and carries no transaction identity -- so it is skipped
+    rather than checked weakly.
